From: Bharathraj Nagaraju <snbraj@codeaurora.org>
Date: Thu, 20 Oct 2016 09:49:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] defconfig: msm: Enable CONFIG_MSM8996_MCTM for MCTM.

Add support for MCTM specific drivers.

Change-Id: Ie1810194bdbddd89be9b759dde04d158d7f2adbe
Signed-off-by: Bharathraj Nagaraju <snbraj@codeaurora.org>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/msm-auto_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/msm-auto_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/msm-auto_defconfig
index 07461e5..441cea1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/msm-auto_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/msm-auto_defconfig
@@ -565,6 +565,7 @@ CONFIG_MSM_SERVICE_NOTIFIER=y
 CONFIG_MSM_QBT1000=y
 CONFIG_MSM_KERNEL_PROTECT=y
 CONFIG_MEM_SHARE_QMI_SERVICE=y
+CONFIG_MSM8996_MCTM=y
 CONFIG_MSM_CLK_CONTROLLER_V2=y
 CONFIG_MSM_MDSS_PLL=y
 CONFIG_REMOTE_SPINLOCK_MSM=y
